{"unit_id":"2123043818__dsh-sidebar-enhance#feature-1","repo":"2123043818/dsh-sidebar-enhance","commit":"b2cf4046f90fc26f37d0aedc334061b320d7991a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-enhance 的功能「主动展示成果」：Agent 可请求侧栏打开文件、改动、工作区文件树、终端或网页，让用户查看交付内容。通过 sidebar_reveal 工具指定展示模式；打开文件时提供路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:163","lib/index.js:277","lib/index.js:323"]}
{"unit_id":"2123043818__dsh-sidebar-enhance#feature-2","repo":"2123043818/dsh-sidebar-enhance","commit":"b2cf4046f90fc26f37d0aedc334061b320d7991a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-enhance 的功能「侧栏浏览器协作」：Agent 可导航到网页、读取标题正文和链接、按文字或 CSS 选择器查找元素，再执行点击、输入、选择、滚动等操作。读页面和交互需用户授权。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/browser.js:412","lib/browser.js:432","lib/browser.js:452","lib/browser.js:504","lib/client.js:1322"]}
